  <strong>[Illustration 1.1 Placement & Prompt]</strong><br/>
  <em>Description: 3D diagram showing random proton alignment vs. alignment under a main static magnetic field B0, with RF excitation pulse tipping net magnetization M0 into the transverse plane.</em><br/>
